sponse-5seed\n281\t  description: 'Extend all dose-response to 5 seeds: 10% (from 1→5), 25%/50% (from\n282\t    3→5). Both TaxEI and Random.'\n283\t  claim: C3\n284\t  priority: 1\n285\t  status: done\n286\t  depends_on:\n287\t  - 5-seed-extension\n288\t  registry_id: v4-random-fixed-inject50-s7\n289\t  results:\n290\t    taxei_10pct: 61.3% ± 8.2pp (61.7/70.2/55.3/51.1/68.1)\n291\t    random_10pct: 63.8% ± 5.4pp (68.1/66.0/55.3/68.1/61.7)\n292\t    taxei_25pct: 52.7% ± 7.6pp (48.9/46.8/46.8/63.8/57.4)\n293\t    random_25pct: 60.0% ± 8.0pp (55.3/61.7/51.1/72.3/59.6)\n294\t    taxei_50pct: 57.4% ± 9.5pp (51.1/70.2/46.8/63.8/55.3)\n295\t    random_50pct: 58.3% ± 11.7pp (57.4/46.8/70.2/70.2/46.8)\n296\t    key_finding: 'Inverted-U taxonomy penalty: 10% (-2.5pp) → 25% (-7.3pp peak) →\n297\t      50% (-0.9pp) → Full (0pp). No safe dose. Universal training lottery at all doses.'\n298\t  notes: 'D034/D035/D036/D038: Complete 5-seed dose-response. 10% overturned D017\n299\t    zero-harm. 25% overturned D023 deterministic-harm. 50% confirms rebound. Taxonomy\n300\t    penalty peaks at 25% and fades. ~24 GPU-hours total.'\n301\t- id: scale-ablation\n302\t  description: Scale to 25K-50K trajectories to match PALADIN's data scale\n303\t  claim: C6\n304\t  priority: 2\n305\t  status: planned\n306\t  depends_on:\n307\t  - dose-response-random\n308\t  notes: 'Tests whether TaxEI''s failure is due to insufficient data scale. Need additional\n309\t    GPT-5.2 trajectory collection (~$30-50).\n310\t\n311\t    '\n312\t- id: recovery-prompting\n313\t  description: In-context recovery examples (few-shot) to isolate training signal\n314\t    vs knowledge\n315\t  claim: C6\n316\t  priority: 3\n317\t  status: planned\n318\t  depends_on:\n319\t  - recovery-eval\n320\t- id: per-operator-deepdive\n321\t  description: Multi-seed recovery eval to validate per-operator patterns (esp. C4\n322\t    +9.1pp)\n323\t  claim: C4\n324\t  priority: 3\n325\t  status: planned\n326\t  depends_on:\n327\t  - recovery-eval\n328\t- id: llama-cross-model\n329\t  description: 'LLaMA-3.1-8B cross-model replication: 3-seed Vanilla/TaxEI/Random\n330\t    on ALFWorld. Tests whether negative result generalizes beyond Qwen3-8B.'\n331\t  claim: C1,C2,C6\n332\t  priority: 1\n333\t  status: planned\n334\t  depends_on:\n335\t  - multiseed-vanilla\n336\t  - multiseed-taxei\n337\t  - multiseed-random\n338\t  notes: 'D042/D045: 3-seed V/T/R (s42/s0/s123). Same training data, same LoRA config\n339\t    (rank=16, α=32), same eval. LLaMA 3.1-8B is the latest non-MoE LLaMA at 8B scale.\n340\t    s42 training in progress (GPU 0-2). s0/s123 after s42 eval. ~16 GPU-h total.\n341\t    Model: Meta-Llama-3.1-8B-Instruct at /root/autodl-tmp/models/Meta-Llama-3.1-8B-Instruct/'\n342\t- id: scale-up-data\n343\t  description: 'Scale trajectory collection from 500→2500 successful trajectories\n344\t    via GPT-5.2. Tests whether TaxEI failure is due to insufficient data scale (PALADIN\n345\t    uses 50K+).'\n346\t  claim: C6\n347\t  priority: 1\n348\t  status: planned\n349\t  depends_on:\n350\t  - data-collection\n351\t  notes: 'Scope expansion (D042). GATE: verify ALFWorld task pool ≥3500 games before\n352\t    API spend. ~$47 API cost. Reduced scope: 3-seed V+T only (~17h GPU with DDP),\n353\t    not full 5-seed×3 (~44h). Phased: collect 1000 first, check trend, then decide\n354\t    2500. CAVEAT: ALFWorld only has ~134 unique tasks, so 2500 trajectories ≈ 19/task\n355\t    — still far below PALADIN task diversity. Frame as: within ALFWorld diversity ceiling,\n356\t    scale is not the bottleneck.'\n357\t  notes: Merged into recovery-eval-multiseed for long paper\n358\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"30ce2e14-84d3-47ec-abae-17f1dfd2f6a2","uuid":"08f522c5-eb08-462c-80af-4eef89ca335a","timestamp":"2026-05-16T15:45:37.548Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0514_2/projects/tax_error_inject_agent/experiment_plan.yaml","content":"experiments:\n- id: baseline\n  description: Qwen3-8B zero-shot ReAct baseline on ALFWorld (47 tasks)\n  claim: context\n  priority: 0\n  status: done\n  registry_id: vanilla-react-baseline\n  depends_on: []\n  results:\n    accuracy: 42.6% (20/47)\n- id: data-collection\n  description: GPT-5.2 trajectory collection for SFT training data\n  claim: prerequisite\n  priority: 0\n  status: done\n  registry_id: traj_collect_500\n  depends_on: []\n  results:\n    success_rate: 70.2% (501/714)\n    cost: $8.86\n- id: v3-pilot\n  description: 'v3 format-aligned pilot: vanilla/TaxEI/random single-seed eval'\n  claim: supplement\n  priority: 0\n  status: done\n  registry_id: v3-vanilla-eval\n  depends_on:\n  - data-collection\n  results:\n    vanilla: 74.5%\n    taxei: 66.0%\n    random: 51.1%\n  notes: 'Superseded by v4. All registry: mini-vanilla-sft-v3, mini-taxei-sft-v3,\n    mini-random-sft-v3, v3-vanilla-eval, v3-taxei-eval, v3-random-eval'\n- id: multiseed-vanilla\n  description: Vanilla SFT 3-seed verification (clean data only, 4,358 samples)\n  claim: C1\n  priority: 1\n  status: done\n  registry_id: v4-vanilla-eval-r3\n  depends_on:\n  - data-collection\n  results:\n    seed42: 61.7%\n    seed0: 68.1%\n    seed123: 66.0%\n    mean_sd: 65.3% ± 3.3pp\n  notes: 'Train: mini-vanilla-sft-v4, v4-vanilla-seed0, v4-vanilla-seed123. Eval:\n    v4-vanilla-eval-r3, v4-vanilla-seed0-eval, v4-vanilla-seed123-eval'\n- id: multiseed-taxei\n  description: TaxEI SFT 3-seed verification (clean + taxonomy-tagged injections,\n    9,029 samples)\n  claim: C1,C2,C3\n  priority: 1\n  status: done\n  registry_id: v4-taxei-eval\n  depends_on:\n  - data-collection\n  results:\n    seed42: 61.7%\n    seed0: 46.8%\n    seed123: 61.7%\n    mean_sd: 56.7% ± 8.6pp\n    vs_vanilla_paired_t_p: 0.32 (NS)\n    vs_vanilla_pooled_p: 0.054 (NS at α=0.05)\n  notes: 'Train: v4-taxei-sft-r2, v4-taxei-seed0, v4-taxei-seed123. Eval: v4-taxei-eval,\n    v4-taxei-seed0-eval, v4-taxei-seed123-eval'\n- id: multiseed-random\n  description: Random SFT 3-seed verification (clean + unlabeled injections, 9,029\n    samples)\n  claim: C2,C3\n  priority: 1\n  status: done\n  registry_id: v4-random-eval\n  depends_on:\n  - data-collection\n  results:\n    seed42: 66.0%\n    seed0: 55.3%\n    seed123: 68.1%\n    mean_sd: 63.1% ± 7.0pp\n    vs_taxei_paired_t_p: 0.034 (suggestive, df=2)\n    vs_taxei_pooled_p: 0.170 (NS)\n  notes: 'Train: v4-random-sft-r2, v4-random-seed0, v4-random-seed123. Eval: v4-random-eval,\n    v4-random-seed0-eval, v4-random-seed123-eval'\n- id: dose-response-taxei\n  description: TaxEI dose-response curve (10%/25%/50% injection, fixed 4,358 total,\n    seed=42)\n  claim: C3\n  priority: 1\n  status: done\n  registry_id: v4-taxei-fixed-inject50-eval\n  depends_on:\n  - multiseed-vanilla\n  results:\n    inject0_baseline: 61.7% (vanilla seed=42)\n    inject10: 61.7% (0pp)\n    inject25: 48.9% (-12.8pp)\n    inject50: 51.1% (-10.6pp)\n    pattern: 'threshold-plateau: 10% harmless, 25% catastrophic collapse, 50% no further\n      worsening'\n  notes: 'Train: v4-taxei-fixed-inject10, v4-taxei-fixed-inject25-r2, v4-taxei-fixed-inject50.\n    Eval: v4-taxei-fixed-inject10-eval, v4-taxei-fixed-inject25-eval, v4-taxei-fixed-inject50-eval'\n- id: dose-response-random\n  description: Random dose-response curve (10%/25%/50% injection, fixed 4,358 total,\n    seed=42)\n  claim: C3\n  priority: 1\n  status: done\n  registry_id: v4-random-fixed-inject50-eval\n  depends_on:\n  - multiseed-vanilla\n  results:\n    inject0_baseline: 61.7% (vanilla seed=42)\n    inject10: 68.1% (32/47, +6.4pp)\n    inject25: 55.3% (26/47, -6.4pp)\n    inject50: 57.4% (27/47, -4.3pp)\n  notes: 'Train: v4-random-fixed-inject10, v4-random-fixed-inject25, v4-random-fixed-inject50.\n    Eval: v4-random-fixed-inject10-eval, v4-random-fixed-inject25-eval, v4-random-fixed-inject50-eval.\n    Random 10% positive effect contrasts with TaxEI 10% zero effect.'\n- id: recovery-eval\n  description: Recovery rate under injected errors (seed=42, 47 tasks, round-robin\n    P1/P2/C1/C4)\n  claim: C4,C5\n  priority: 1\n  status: done\n  registry_id: v4-taxei-recovery-eval-r2\n  depends_on:\n  - multiseed-vanilla\n  - multiseed-taxei\n  - multiseed-random\n  results:\n    vanilla_recovery: 61.7%\n    taxei_recovery: 59.6%\n    random_recovery: 63.8%\n    detection_rate: 0% (all methods)\n    taxei_per_operator: C1=66.7%, C4=63.6%, P1=58.3%, P2=50.0%\n  notes: 'All registry: v4-vanilla-recovery-eval, v4-taxei-recovery-eval, v4-taxei-recovery-eval-r2,\n    v4-random-recovery-eval'\n- id: recovery-paired-injection\n  description: 'Recovery-paired error injection on ALFWorld: each injected error trajectory\n    is immediately followed by the correct recovery demonstration (mimicking PALADIN''s\n    recovery-pairing design). Compare TaxEI-RP vs TaxEI (unpaired) vs Vanilla to disentangle\n    recovery-pairing from task-structure hypothesis.\n\n    '\n  claim: C7\n  priority: 1\n  status: done\n  depends_on:\n  - multiseed-taxei\n  - multiseed-vanilla\n  results:\n    seed42: 38.3%\n    seed0: 46.8%\n    seed1: 48.9%\n    seed123: 57.4%\n    mean_sd: 47.9% ± 7.8pp\n    vs_taxei: -10.4pp (worse)\n    vs_vanilla: -19.4pp (worse)\n    detection_rate: 0% (all seeds)\n    key_finding: Recovery pairing actively harms — not PALADIN's missing ingredient.\n      Task structure confirmed as primary moderator (D043).\n  notes: 'D043: Recovery-paired injection (14,437 samples = TaxEI 9,029 + recovery\n    continuations 5,408) performs WORSE than unpaired TaxEI. Recovery demonstrations\n    do not teach active recovery in embodied planning. Claim 7 definitively answered:\n    No. s7 training in progress for 5th seed.'\n  registry_id: v4-taxei-rp-s1\n- id: webshop-replication\n  description: 'CANCELLED (D040): Downgraded to Discussion section analysis. P1_StepOrderSwap\n    incompatible with WebShop linear action space (search+click only). Taxonomy 4→3\n    makes cross-env comparison inequivalent.'